tent": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Cobalt Labs invoice INV-59040 once, by wire, for $4,035.53.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001 (wire, status \"sent\")\n- **Invoice:** INV-59040 is now marked paid.\n\nThe first wire request timed out, so I checked the payment list before retrying. PAY0001 already showed the wire as sent, so I did not send a second one. The invoice had not updated to paid, so I linked PAY0001 to INV-59040 to record it.\n\nCobalt Labs' other invoices were left alone. INV-24311 ($5,721.11) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-56025 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}